* Averaged return ratio at idle COM=11.3V. NOT switching stability proof.
* Only U1 is a vendor macro. PWM/driver averaged; assumed25ns delay.
.include "../models/compatible/OPA859.lib"
.param KMOD=288.737353935 TD=25n CHEAD=1n
Vlogic logic 0 5
Vmid mid 0 1.65
Vnorm rnorm 0 0.720079386669
Vpd pd 0 5
Rplus rnorm plus 249
Rbias mid plus 2.94k
Cref_filter plus mid 1.6n
Xerror plus minus logic 0 error pd OA859_OPA859
Rfb error minus 2.94k
* Voltage injection: sense is feedback-side, out is plant-side.
Vprobe sense out DC 0 AC 1
RmeasureA sense minus 15k
RmeasureB sense minus 15k
RgainA minus gainmid 255
RgainB gainmid 0 2.55
Rlead error lead 2.94k
Clead error lead 124.7p
Rleadr lead mid 215
Ccmp lead mid 2p
Rmixlead lead mix 13.3k
Rmixref rnorm mix 100k
Rmixhi logic mix 158k
Rmixlo mix 0 113k
* Natural PWM gain: 60V divided by measured carrier peak-to-peak.
* Nominal centred triangle is MID. No limiter: small-signal model only.
Bcommand command 0 V=30+KMOD*V(mix,mid)
* First-order all-pass Pade delay: (1-s*TD/2)/(1+s*TD/2).
Rdelay command state 1k
Cdelay state 0 {TD/2000}
Baverage sw 0 V=2*V(state)-V(command)
Lfilter sw lout 500n
Rcoil lout shunt 0.0165
Rshunt shunt damp 0.001
RdampA damp out 0.22
RdampB damp out 0.22
Cfixed out 0 468n
Rcable out cable 0.22
Lcable cable head 10n
Cload head 0 {CHEAD}
Rleak head 0 10Meg
.options numdgt=7 plotwinsize=0
.save V(sense) V(out) V(head) V(error) V(mix)
.op
.ac dec 120 1k 3Meg
.end
